{"id":"07bb4f1dbc54e232","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-jump-strict-def.md","title":"Jump Strict Inequality Definition","display":"thm-jump-strict-def — Jump Strict Inequality Definition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-jump-strict-def","aliases":["88-thm-jump-strict-def"],"display":"thm-jump-strict-def — Jump Strict Inequality Definition","depends_on":["[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","[[88-df-turing-jump]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-jump-strict-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-jump-strict-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jump-strict-def — Jump Strict Inequality Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c24d037bf910fb4b\" href=\"?note=c24d037bf910fb4b\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-parameterization\">88-lem-oracle-parameterization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)=A&#39;\">\\(J(A)=A&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li>统一查询索引函数的存在性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c24d037bf910fb4b\" href=\"?note=c24d037bf910fb4b\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-parameterization\">88-lem-oracle-parameterization</a> 给出；其索引不依赖待查询的神谕。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump\\text{-}strict\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;A\\leq_TJ(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump\\text{-}strict\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;A\\leq_TJ(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取统一查询函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{q(x)}^A(n)\">\\(\\varphi_{q(x)}^A(n)\\)</span> 对任意输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 收敛当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=q(x)\">\\(n=q(x)\\)</span>，由对角跳跃定义得到</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\leftrightarrow q(x)\\in J(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in A\\leftrightarrow q(x)\\in J(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在神谕 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)\">\\(J(A)\\)</span> 下先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)\">\\(q(x)\\)</span> 再查询该位，即得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的总特征函数。这里需要 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> <strong>总可计算且对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 一致</strong>；逐个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,A\">\\(x,A\\)</span> 的无效索引选择不能证明归约。严格性中的反向不可归约部分另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3d14d294ed1b6514\" href=\"?note=3d14d294ed1b6514\" title=\"88-thm-jump-strict\">88-thm-jump-strict</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-parameterization","status":"resolved","id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$J(A)=A'$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]、[[88-df-turing-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$J(A)=A'$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]、[[88-df-turing-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\leq_T$ 见 [[88-df-turing-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\leq_T$ 见 [[88-df-turing-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-parameterization","status":"resolved","id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"统一查询索引函数的存在性由 [[88-lem-oracle-parameterization]] 给出；其索引不依赖待查询的神谕。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-jump-strict","status":"resolved","id":"3d14d294ed1b6514","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"在神谕 $J(A)$ 下先计算 $q(x)$ 再查询该位，即得到 $A$ 的总特征函数。这里需要 $q$ **总可计算且对全部 $A$ 一致**；逐个 $x,A$ 的无效索引选择不能证明归约。严格性中的反向不可归约部分另见 [[88-thm-jump-strict]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"J(A)=A'","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump\\text{-}strict\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;A\\leq_TJ(A)","display":true},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{q(x)}^A(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"n=q(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A\\leftrightarrow q(x)\\in J(A).","display":true},{"tex":"J(A)","display":false},{"tex":"q(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x,A","display":false}],"bytes":1365,"backlinks":[{"id":"3d14d294ed1b6514","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正向归约已由 [[88-thm-jump-strict-def]] 证明。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]\n[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md]]\n[[88-thm-ls-upward.md]]\n[[88-thm-partial-tm-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-problem-solved.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-theorem.md]]\n[[88-thm-pr-total.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice-proof.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice.md]]\n[[88-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-sigma1-complete.md]]\n[[88-thm-smn.md]]\n[[88-thm-soundness.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-equals-recursive.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-recursive.md]]"}],"outgoing":["c749f46fbad31f8b","2b6a4a081d493b4c","ceb241b03d936136","baf8d9aebf7edfa1","c24d037bf910fb4b","3d14d294ed1b6514"]}